  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The solar-powered water system for Atauro Island is being rehabilitated to deliver clean, reliable water to its 1,259 residents in Suco Beloi and Suco Biqueli. The original system failed because it couldn&#x2019;t handle the island&#x2019;s steep terrain and hydrology, which ranges from 8 meters at Adara Aldea to 328 meters at the main water source</narrative>
